  "description": "Lighter. Stiffer. Faster.\nThe Super Corsa RC version pushes the boundaries of the Super Corsa even further.\n\nThe implementation of premium high-modulus carbon fiber, combined with high-precision monocoque molding, allows for ultra-thin, optimized internal tube walls—drastically reducing overall weight while maximizing torsional stiffness.\n\nFrame Technology\nThe monocoque frame is constructed from ultra-high-modulus carbon fiber. This specific engineering approach allows us to:\n\nReduce internal tube thickness to minimize weight.\n\nIncrease stiffness at key high-stress points.\n\nImprove the absorption of micro-vibrations from the road surface.\n\nThe bike is equipped with modern technical solutions to optimize both performance and maintenance:\n\nFully Integrated Cable Routing: Clean internal routing through the frame and handlebar, improving aerodynamics and aesthetics.\n\nIntegrated Seat Clamp: The fastening system is seamlessly hidden within the frame to maintain clean, uninterrupted lines.\n\nKey Benefits of the Frameset (Frame, Fork, Seatpost):\n\nOn the Climbs: Ultimate weight savings to conquer the steepest gradients with less effort.\n\nResponsiveness: Instant power transfer that rewards every out-of-the-saddle acceleration.\n\nOn the Descents: Millimeter-perfect stability and razor-sharp, confidence-inspiring handling.\n\nActive Comfort: Engineered carbon layup dampens road vibrations, reducing muscle fatigue on long-distance rides.",
